WEBVTT

00:00:00.136 --> 00:00:03.934
You have practiced turning toward God.

00:00:03.934 --> 00:00:07.005
Now practice listening.

00:00:07.005 --> 00:00:12.984
You do not have to force a revelation or manufacture a feeling.

00:00:12.984 --> 00:00:21.587
Notice what Scripture stirs in you, what distracts you, and what faithful response is possible.

00:00:21.587 --> 00:00:34.015
The divine Father, approached through Jesus, can speak through His Word, through wisdom, through circumstances, and through a clear next act.

00:00:34.015 --> 00:00:40.731
Let the silence become a place where you do not rush to fill every space.

00:00:40.731 --> 00:00:46.209
Receive what is present, and remain open to correction.

00:00:46.209 --> 00:00:52.549
You do not need to understand the whole road to take the next faithful step.

00:00:52.549 --> 00:00:54.919
Now listen.
